-- Sworn Script Example for an Ironsworn classic session
--
-- This follows the o.g. book page 202
classic

-- CREATE YOUR CHARACTER (page 193)
"""Your Character"""
-- 1 Envision your character (page 31)
roll character oracles
-- 2 Choose a name (page 33)
roll ironlander name oracle
-- 3 Set your stats by arranging these bonuses across edge, heart, iron, shadow, and wits in any order: 3, 2, 2, 1, 1 (page 33)
-- TODO: stats + character sheet
-- 4 Set your health, spirit, and supply to +5 (page 33)
-- TODO: meters
-- 5 Set your momentum to +2, your max momentum to +10, and your momentum reset to +2 (page 35)
-- TODO: momentum

-- CREATE YOUR WORLD
"""Your World"""
roll truths

"""Your Starting Location"""
roll region
roll location
roll name settlement oracle -- --> environmental
roll environmental oracle
-- or: roll quick_name settlement oracles

-- 6 Mark up to three background bonds (page 36).

roll character oracles
roll challenge_rank
roll forge_a_bond

roll trouble
roll challenge_rank
roll forge_a_bond

-- roll forge_a_bond -- bank for later

-- 7 Pick three assets (page 39)
-- roll companion assets
wyvern asset
-- roll path assets
masked
-- roll combat_talent assets
sunderer -- --> "tribute to fallen foe" is third bond
roll challenge_rank
roll forge_a_bond


-- 8 Make note of any important equipment or items (page 45)
-- TODO: inventory
-- 9 Set a background vow, and give it a rank of extreme or epic.
-- TODO: vows
--   Then, envision your inciting incident and Swear an Iron Vow. 
roll action_and_theme oracles
roll swear_an_iron_vow

-- ADVENTURE EXAMPLE

roll undertake_a_journey
roll make_camp -- miss
roll face_danger

-- COMBAT EXAMPLE
-- check available NPC collections
npcs
-- check Horrors
horrors npcs
bonewalker
-- check Combat Moves Reference
combat moves
roll enter_the_fray -- miss --> in a bad spot
roll combat_action
roll clash -- strong_hit --> in control
roll strike -- miss
roll pay_the_price oracle
turn_the_tide
strike:strong_hit
end_the_fight

-- OVERLAND TRAVEL EXAMPLE
-- roll undertake_a_journey
undertake_a_journey : strong_hit
-- envision waypoint
roll descriptor place oracle
roll location place oracle
roll major_plot_twist


